+# @zcode/zcode-cua-plugin (Ycode fork bundle)
+
+Vendored payload of the official `computer-use` plugin (upstream 0.6.4, MIT, Z.ai),
+seeded by the CLI bootstrap (`OFFICIAL_PLUGIN_DEFINITIONS` → filesystem seed) into the
+official plugin cache. Deliberately WITHOUT `node_modules/`: the skill bootstrap talks
+to the node_repl host bridge, and this fork's `packages/zcode-cua` (overlay patches
+003/004) provides the in-process runtime (macOS: JXA + screencapture; no Helper,
+no sharp/koffi).
+
+Source of truth for content updates: the official plugin cache / upstream producer
+repo — refresh payload here when bumping `version` in `official-plugin-definitions.ts`.
diff --git a/packages/zcode-cua-plugin/docs/computer-use.md b/packages/zcode-cua-plugin/docs/computer-use.md
